# CoffeeApplicationRuntime — Lifecycle

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant EP as Entry Point<br/>(main, CLI, worker)
    participant RT as CoffeeApplicationRuntime
    participant CFG as Config
    participant CTN as CoffeeApplicationContainer
    participant APP as Application Logic

    EP->>RT: @CoffeeApplicationRuntime()<br/>async def main(app)
    RT->>RT: __init__(container=None)
    RT->>RT: init()
    RT->>CFG: Config().build()
    CFG-->>RT: config instance
    RT->>CTN: CoffeeApplicationContainer(config)
    CTN-->>RT: container
    RT->>EP: injeta runtime (app)
    EP->>APP: executa lógica<br/>app.getContainer().getConfig()
    APP-->>EP: resultado
    EP->>RT: retorno (normal ou exception)
    RT->>RT: stop() em try/finally
    RT->>CTN: container = None
    RT-->>EP: controle devolvido
```

