# Python ↔ C++ Engine Protocol

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant PY as Coffee CLI (Python)
    participant IPC as IPC Protocol
    participant CPP as C++ Engine

    Note over PY,CPP: Opção A: JSON sobre stdin/stdout
    PY->>IPC: spawn C++ process
    PY->>IPC: stdin: {"op": "system_info", "args": {}}
    IPC->>CPP: stdin read
    CPP->>CPP: executa operação nativa
    CPP->>IPC: stdout: {"result": {...}, "error": null}
    IPC->>PY: stdout read + parse JSON
    
    Note over PY,CPP: Opção B: gRPC
    PY->>IPC: gRPC call SystemInfo({})
    IPC->>CPP: gRPC request
    CPP->>IPC: gRPC response
    IPC->>PY: response object
    
    Note over PY,CPP: Opção C: Named Pipe / Unix Socket
    PY->>IPC: connect pipe/socket
    PY->>IPC: send MessagePack
    IPC->>CPP: read + decode
    CPP->>IPC: write MessagePack
    IPC->>PY: read + decode
```

