# Context Resolution Flow

```mermaid
graph LR
    REQ[Request<br/>AI Harness / CLI] --> RESOLVER[Context Resolver]
    
    subgraph "Context Sources"
        USER_PROF[User Profile]
        PROJ[Project]
        REPO[Repository]
        GIT_STATE[Git State]
        TASK[Task]
        DOCS[Documentation]
        DECISIONS[Decisions]
        MACHINE[Machine]
        RUNTIME_STATE[Runtime State]
        EXT_DATA[External Data]
    end
    
    RESOLVER --> USER_PROF
    RESOLVER --> PROJ
    RESOLVER --> REPO
    RESOLVER --> GIT_STATE
    RESOLVER --> TASK
    RESOLVER --> DOCS
    RESOLVER --> DECISIONS
    RESOLVER --> MACHINE
    RESOLVER --> RUNTIME_STATE
    RESOLVER --> EXT_DATA
    
    RESOLVER --> PACK[Context Pack<br/>Relevant Information Only]
    PACK --> CLIENT[AI Harness / Client]
```